  data: {
    LLM: '1. Bid min 2; dealer forced to bid min if all pass. Dealer can steal by equalling. 2. High bidder names trump. 3. All discard non-trumps. 4. Dealer refills to 6. 5. Play tricks. Must follow suit. 6. Trump 5 = 5 points to side that wins it.',
    Player: '1. Bid min 2; dealer forced to bid min if all pass. Dealer can steal by equalling. 2. High bidder names trump. 3. All discard non-trumps. 4. Dealer refills to 6. 5. Play tricks. Must follow suit. 6. Trump 5 = 5 points to side that wins it.',
